#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:122
#: 0cb7bea51853494a88bfef19e6997370
msgid "These values can be either set manually or using Mission Planner"
msgstr "这些数值可以手动设置，也可以通过 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:126
#: 096d2bd9a37f407e9a08d577d83e093a
msgid "Setting with Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:128
#: 23b7362dff774a0489e66fc9a716b104
msgid ""
"Rate Roll P and Rate Pitch P will be used in the following example procedure"
msgstr "以下示例步骤将使用 Rate Roll P 和 Rate Pitch P"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:133
#: 9f432ca8d4004f7db3b3c470be73f4d3
msgid "Connect your autopilot to Mission Planner"
msgstr "将飞控连接到 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:134
#: 003ad35b856947f3be02a470f4c74993
msgid ""
"From parameter list, assign channel ``x`` to transmitter tuning with "
"``RCx_OPTION`` = 219."
msgstr "从参数列表中，将通道 ``x`` 分配给遥控器调参，设置 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 219。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:135
#: 5664845d79e5429cbad82d88b2baa542
msgid "On Mission Planner, select CONFIG>>Extended Tuning"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中，选择 CONFIG>>Extended Tuning"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:136
#: 1f028cee766c49a9a6e62b198e6d714e
msgid "Set the TUNE drop down box option to \"Rate Roll/Pitch kP\""
msgstr "将 TUNE 下拉框选项设置为 「Rate Roll/Pitch kP」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:137
#: 6a76931393634169bf2a11bc30cd80cc
msgid ""
"Set Min to 0.08, Max to 0.20 (most copters ideal gain is within this range "
"although from a small number of copter the Max can be as high as 0.25)"
msgstr "将最小值设为 0.08，最大值设为 0.20（大多数飞机的理想增益在此范围内，但少数飞机最大值可达 0.25）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:140
#: 9db68c03029649078d858aa63a07eb3d
msgid "Push the \"Write Params\" button"
msgstr "点击 「Write Params」 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:141
#: 192cd95fbbf54c92a5b641bc568f3543
msgid ""
"Turn your transmitter's CHx tuning knob to the minimum position, press the "
"\"Refresh Params\" button and ensure that the Rate Roll P and Rate Pitch P "
"values become 0.08 (or something very close)"
msgstr ""
"将遥控器的 CHx 调参旋钮转到最小位置，点击 「Refresh Params」 按钮，确认 Rate Roll P 和 Rate Pitch P "
"的值变为 0.08（或非常接近的值）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:144
#: f32fcb8af92e4786b3b40551293acc70
msgid ""
"Turn the CHx knob to its maximum position, press \"Refresh Params\" and "
"ensure the Rate Roll P moves to 0.20"
msgstr "将 CHx 旋钮转到最大位置，点击 「Refresh Params」，确认 Rate Roll P 移动到 0.20"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:146
#: c627c305f85f4433a849c14b99df2470
msgid "Move the CHx knob back to the middle"
msgstr "将 CHx 旋钮移回中间位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:147
#: 89c767acf2124cc2985e3a61ab59045a
msgid ""
"Arm and fly your copter in Stabilize mode adjusting the CHx knob until you "
"get a copter that is responsive but not wobbly"
msgstr "在 Stabilize 模式下解锁并飞行，调整 CHx 旋钮，直到飞机响应灵敏且不晃动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:149
#: bb860e5a213844fc86ba9784cfea3c16
msgid ""
"After the flight, disconnect your LiPo battery and reconnect the autopilot "
"to the mission planner"
msgstr "飞行结束后，断开 LiPo 电池并将飞控重新连接到 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:150
#: 7f98b3ac59724006bc68c15a3301f637
msgid ""
"With the CHx knob in the position that gave the best performance, return to "
"the Copter Pids screen and push the \"Refresh Params\" button"
msgstr "将 CHx 旋钮保持在表现最佳的位置，返回 Copter Pids 页面并点击 「Refresh Params」 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:152
#: f4a9f67f9e704f2eae5ca62c66761114
msgid ""
"In the Rate Roll P and Rate Pitch P fields re-type the value that you see "
"but just slightly modified so that the mission planner recognizes that it's "
"changed and resends to the autopilot (Note: if you re-type exactly the same "
"number as what appears in Rate Roll P it won't be updated).  So for example,"
" if the Rate Roll P appears as \"0.1213\" make it \"0.1200\""
msgstr ""
"在 Rate Roll P 和 Rate Pitch P 字段中，重新输入当前显示的值，但稍作修改，使 Mission Planner "
"识别到变化并重新发送给飞控（注意：如果重新输入与 Rate Roll P 中完全相同的数字，则不会更新）。例如，如果 Rate Roll P 显示为 "
"「0.1213」，则将其改为 「0.1200」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:158
#: f5520382b705453887dddae838b2ed99
msgid "Set CHx Opt back to \"None\" and push \"Write Params\""
msgstr "将 CHx Opt 设回 「None」 并点击 「Write Params」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:159
#: cca7a192e5c249f6a39b9ea29cdda0a4
msgid "Push the Disconnect button on the top right, and the Connect"
msgstr "点击右上角的 Disconnect 按钮，然后点击 Connect"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:160
#: afc7c2a3f481436d8f00b3244a33ad78
msgid ""
"Ensure that the Rate Roll P value is the value that you retyped in step #13"
msgstr "确认 Rate Roll P 的值是您在第 13 步中重新输入的值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:163
#: c8c9979b6b664af3bc0a04ba5db15733
msgid ""
"While you are moving the tuning knob the values update at 3 times per "
"second.  The need to press the Refresh button in the mission planner in "
"steps #7 and #8 above is just because the Copter is not sending the updates "
"to the mission planner in real-time."
msgstr ""
"移动调参旋钮时，数值每秒更新 3 次。上述第 7 步和第 8 步需要按 Refresh 按钮，是因为飞机不会实时将更新发送给 Mission "
"Planner。"
